        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P004",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "What happened",
      "text": "The court allowed the prosecution to proceed with task-force testimony while recording the defense's continuing objection and requiring the witness, rather than counsel, to characterize the alleged statements.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S00049",
          "start_seconds": 1335.99,
