        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P006",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The court's directions",
      "text": "The court permitted the task-force testimony subject to the defense's continuing objection; it described the alleged threat as a proposition the prosecution would try to prove, not as a court conclusion.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S00049",
          "start_seconds": 1335.99,
          "clock": "00:22:15",
          "speaker_name": "Sen. Francis \"Chiz\" G. Escudero"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00050",
