          "speaker_name": "Sen. Francis \"Chiz\" G. Escudero"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00051",
          "start_seconds": 1419.7,
          "clock": "00:23:39",
          "speaker_name": "Sen. Francis \"Chiz\" G. Escudero"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P007",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The court's directions",
      "text": "The court denied the defense request to strike Matibag's answer about the task force's observations, leaving its weight for the senator-judges' appreciation.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S00282",
          "start_seconds": 3763.4,
          "clock": "01:02:43",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Mark C. Vinluan"
        },
        {
