        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P008",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The court's directions",
      "text": "On the Lascañas statement, the court allowed Matibag to say it had passed through or was used in the NBI inquiry, but not to establish the truth of its allegations through his testimony.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S00533",
          "start_seconds": 5562.29,
          "clock": "01:32:42",
          "speaker_name": "Sen. Francis \"Chiz\" G. Escudero"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00535",
