          "start_seconds": 5893.22,
          "clock": "01:38:13",
          "speaker_name": "Sen. Francis \"Chiz\" G. Escudero"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P009",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "Senator-judge question",
      "text": "Joel Villanueva asked how an ongoing NBI inquiry relates to impeachment; he also distinguished the court's constitutional accountability function from a criminal determination.",
