          "speaker_name": "Sen. Joel Villanueva"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P010",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "Senator-judge question",
      "text": "Raffy Tulfo compared the handling of the Ronell Mas case with the NBI's treatment of statements attributed to the Vice President; Matibag said he could not speak for the earlier NBI investigation and described procedural lapses in the earlier arrest.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S01305",
