    {
      "id": "P011",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "Senator-judge question",
      "text": "Risa Hontiveros asked about Princess Maui and Oplan Romanov, including whether the NBI had actionable intelligence concerning threats to the President and Vice President.",
