        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P020",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "Witnesses and evidence",
      "text": "Videos and an affidavit of authentication were displayed or identified during direct examination, but their presentation did not itself decide what weight the court would give them.",
      "citations": [
